msgid "Ryuuji「Well......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Bueno......」"

msgid "Minori「Without you around, Taiga's such an＿oversleeper! She was very nearly late!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Sin ti cerca, Taiga se queda dormida!＿¡Por poco llega tarde!」"

msgid "Taiga「Minorin! I told you I don't need that＿dilly-dally dog!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Minorin! ¡Te dije que no necesito＿a ese perro remolón!」"

msgid "Minori「Oh, you～ You're not fooling anyone!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Ay, tú～ No engañas a nadie!」"

msgid "Taiga「I mean it!! I'm really, TRULY just fine on＿my own!! I can handle anything!!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡¡Lo digo en serio!! ¡¡De VERDAD estoy＿bien sola!! ¡¡Puedo con todo!!」"

msgid "Kitamura「Oho, you're ready and raring to go this＿semester! Mm, quite fitting of a＿student! I shall follow your example!!」"
msgstr "Kitamura「¡Oho, vienes con todas las ganas este＿semestre! ¡Mm, muy propio de una＿estudiante! ¡¡Seguiré tu ejemplo!!」"

msgid "Minori「Hell yeah, me too!!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡¡Claro que sí, yo también!!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「..................」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「..................」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Seeing her like this, Kushieda's the＿same as ever...... No different than she＿was before Christmas Eve......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Viéndola así, Kushieda es la misma＿de siempre...... Igual que antes＿de Nochebuena......）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「..................」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「..................」"

msgid "Minori「Oi, Takasu-kun, is my face really that＿interesting?」"
msgstr "Minori「Oye, Takasu-kun, ¿de verdad es＿tan interesante mi cara?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Huh? Uh, err......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Eh? Eh, ehm......」"

msgid "Taiga「......Kitamura-kun, I need to ask you＿something.」"
msgstr "Taiga「......Kitamura-kun, necesito＿preguntarte algo.」"

msgid "Kitamura「What is it?」"
msgstr "Kitamura「¿Qué pasa?」"

msgid "Taiga「It's about the school trip. I have a＿question.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Es sobre el viaje escolar.＿Tengo una pregunta.」"

msgid "Kitamura「Go for it. Ask me anything, and I will＿attempt to answer to the best of my＿ability.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Adelante. Pregúntame lo que sea, e＿intentaré responder lo mejor que pueda.」"

msgid "Taiga「Thanks. I need to take a look at the＿calendar, so can you meet me at my＿desk?」"
msgstr "Taiga「Gracias. Necesito revisar el calendario,＿¿puedes ir a mi pupitre?」"

msgid "Kitamura「Sure thing.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Por supuesto.」"

msgid "Taiga「Hmph!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Jum!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Why is Taiga acting like that......? She＿shook her head all haughty-like......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（¿Por qué Taiga actúa así......? Sacudió＿la cabeza toda altanera......）」"

msgid "Minori「The school field trip sounds like fun, I＿reckon.」"
msgstr "Minori「El viaje escolar suena＿divertido, supongo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（I see, so Taiga was purposefully＿leaving me and Kushieda alone＿together......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Ya veo, Taiga nos dejó solos a＿propósito a Kushieda y a mí......）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（There's no point in doing that now,＿though. She already rejected me, after＿all......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Aunque ya no tiene sentido＿hacer eso. Después de todo,＿ella ya me rechazó......）」"

msgid "Minori「With a field trip so soon after the end＿of winter break, it's like everyone's still＿in break mode, huh?」"
msgstr "Minori「Con un viaje escolar tan pronto después＿de las vacaciones de invierno, todos＿siguen en modo vacaciones, ¿no?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Yeah...... You're right.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Sí...... Tienes razón.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Yeah, I had to deal with that...... But it＿was still fun. We got to go to Luxure＿and all.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Sí, tuve que lidiar con eso......＿Pero aun así fue divertido. Pudimos＿ir a Luxure y todo.」"

msgid "Minori「Luxure was such a blast～! And＿personally, I had a great time at the＿test of courage too!!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Luxure fue lo máximo～! ¡¡Y en lo＿personal, también me divertí mucho＿en la prueba de valor!!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「..................」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「..................」"

msgid "Minori「Sucks that I didn't get to see the＿ghost, but at least I got to savor the＿thrill of a real haunted house!」"
msgstr "Minori「Qué mal que no vi al fantasma, ¡pero＿al menos disfruté la emoción de una＿casa embrujada de verdad!」"

msgid "Minori「Huh? What's wrong, Takasu-kun?」"
msgstr "Minori「¿Eh? ¿Qué pasa, Takasu-kun?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Uhh............ Yeah, the test of courage＿was pretty scary.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ehh............ Sí, la prueba＿de valor dio bastante miedo.」"

msgid "Minori「I know, right!?」"
msgstr "Minori「¡¿Verdad que sí?!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......We had a lot of fun, huh?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Nos divertimos mucho, ¿eh?」"

msgid "Minori「Yep! Couldn't ask for a better winter＿break!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Sí! ¡No podría pedir mejores＿vacaciones de invierno!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Yeah......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Sí......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Sorry, Kushieda. I gotta use the＿restroom.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Perdón, Kushieda. Tengo que ir al baño.」"

msgid "Minori「Oh really? Take care! Up and bladd 'er!」"
msgstr "Minori「¿Ah, sí? ¡Cuídate! ¡Arriba y a desaguar!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......*Sigh*」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......*Suspiro*」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Thought that would have been more＿awkward, but I was able to talk to her＿just fine......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Pensé que sería más incómodo, pero pude＿hablar con ella sin problema......）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（......Maybe I owe that to my amnesia too.）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（......Tal vez se lo deba＿también a mi amnesia.）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（I'd prefer a friendly, chatty relationship＿with Kushieda over something strained＿and awkward.）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Prefiero una relación amistosa＿y alegre con Kushieda que algo＿tenso e incómodo.）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（If Taiga knew, she'd hurl insults like＿\"You coward!!\" at me.）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Si Taiga lo supiera, me gritaría＿insultos como \"¡¡Cobarde!!\".）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「*Sigh*......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「*Suspiro*......」"

msgid "Noto「Oh, Takasu! What was that big sigh＿for?」"
msgstr "Noto「¡Oh, Takasu! ¿Y ese gran suspiro?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I kinda have a lot on my plate.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Tengo muchas cosas en la cabeza.」"

msgid "Noto「That so?」"
msgstr "Noto「¿En serio?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Yeah......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Sí......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（It's a little late now, but accepting that＿is my only option......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Es un poco tarde ya, pero aceptarlo＿es mi única opción......）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「............Oh, that reminds me......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「............Ah, ahora＿que me acuerdo......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Hey, Kitamura!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Oye, Kitamura!」"

msgid "Kitamura「What's up?」"
msgstr "Kitamura「¿Qué pasa?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Where's Kawashima? Doesn't look like＿she's here yet.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Dónde está Kawashima? Parece＿que aún no llega.」"

msgid "Kitamura「Ami's............」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Ami............」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Out sick or something?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Está enferma o algo?」"

msgid "Kitamura「Didn't Ami tell you?」"
msgstr "Kitamura「¿No te dijo Ami?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Tell me what?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Decirme qué?」"

msgid "Kitamura「I see...... I assumed you already knew......」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Ya veo...... Supuse que＿ya lo sabías......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Did something happen?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Pasó algo?」"

msgid "Haruta「What whaaat? Lookin' for Ami-chan? I＿saw her, dude.」"
msgstr "Haruta「¿Qué quéee? ¿Buscas a Ami-chan?＿Yo la vi, amigo.」"

msgid "Kitamura「What!?」"
msgstr "Kitamura「¡¿Qué?!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Where?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Dónde?」"

msgid "Haruta「Ummm, in front of the staff room, I＿think.」"
msgstr "Haruta「Emmm, frente a la sala＿de profesores, creo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「The staff room?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿La sala de profesores?」"

msgid "Yuri「Okay, take your seats!」"
msgstr "Yuri「¡Muy bien, tomen asiento!」"

msgid "Yuri「Good morning, everyone!」"
msgstr "Yuri「¡Buenos días a todos!」"

msgid "Yuri「Actually, there's a bit of sad news that＿we must discuss this morning. You＿see......」"
msgstr "Yuri「En realidad, hay una noticia＿algo triste que debemos tratar＿esta mañana. Verán......」"

msgid "Yuri「Kawashima Ami-san will be＿transferring to a different school.」"
msgstr "Yuri「Kawashima Ami-san se transferirá＿a otra escuela.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Wha......!?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡¿Qué......?!」"

msgid "Everyone「WHAAAT!?」"
msgstr "Todos「¡¿QUÉEE?!」"

msgid "Yuri「I only just found out myself...... It's＿sudden, but the paperwork has＿already been processed.」"
msgstr "Yuri「Yo misma me acabo de enterar......＿Es repentino, pero el papeleo＿ya fue tramitado.」"

msgid "Kashii「No......!」"
msgstr "Kashii「¡No......!」"

msgid "Kihara「Ami-chan never told us about this!!」"
msgstr "Kihara「¡¡Ami-chan nunca nos dijo nada de esto!!」"

msgid "Kashii「Then...... Sensei, when is Ami-chan's＿transfer date?」"
msgstr "Kashii「Entonces...... Sensei, ¿cuándo es la＿fecha de traslado de Ami-chan?」"

msgid "Yuri「......She won't be coming back here, I'm＿afraid.」"
msgstr "Yuri「......Me temo que ya no＿volverá por aquí.」"

msgid "Kihara「No way!! I never got a chance to say＿goodbye......」"
msgstr "Kihara「¡¡No puede ser!! Ni siquiera pude＿despedirme de ella......」"

msgid "Yuri「This is heartbreaking for me too.」"
msgstr "Yuri「Para mí también es desgarrador.」"

msgid "Kitamura「Okay...... Guys, let's all head out into the＿hallway.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Bien...... Chicos, salgamos＿todos al pasillo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Kawashima's transferring......?）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（¿Kawashima se transfiere......?）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（I was so cruel to her, and yet this is＿how our friendship ends......!?）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Fui tan cruel con ella, y aun＿así, ¡¿así es como termina nuestra＿amistad......?!）」"

msgid "Haruta「Taka-chan～ Didja get a load of that? I＿can't believe Ami-chan would＿transfer～」"
msgstr "Haruta「Taka-chan～ ¿Oíste eso? No puedo creer＿que Ami-chan se vaya a transferir～」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Haruta...... Oh!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Haruta...... ¡Ah!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Didn't you say you ran into＿Kawashima?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿No dijiste que te topaste＿con Kawashima?」"

msgid "Haruta「Huh? Oh, yeah, I did. Wha? But why＿was she there? They said she wouldn't＿be coming back.」"
msgstr "Haruta「¿Eh? Ah, sí, la vi. ¿Qué? Pero＿¿por qué estaba ahí? Dijeron＿que ya no volvería.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Got it.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Entendido.」"

msgid "Haruta「Got what?」"
msgstr "Haruta「¿Qué entendiste?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Haruta, I'm sorry, but I'm ditching the＿opening ceremony. Make up some＿kinda excuse for me.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Haruta, lo siento, pero me voy＿a saltar la ceremonia de apertura.＿Invéntame alguna excusa.」"

msgid "Haruta「Huh? Why's that?」"
msgstr "Haruta「¿Eh? ¿Y eso por qué?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Just do it, Haruta.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Solo hazlo, Haruta.」"

msgid "Haruta「......Shucks, I can never say no to you～＿You can count on me!」"
msgstr "Haruta「......Rayos, nunca puedo decirte＿que no～ ¡Cuenta conmigo!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Thanks.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Gracias.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Kawashima......!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Kawashima......!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh yeah, the new semester starts＿tomorrow. I'll make you some food, but＿you'll need to reheat it and eat it on」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, sí, el nuevo semestre empieza＿mañana. Te prepararé comida, pero＿tendrás que calentarla y comerla por」"

msgid "Ryuuji「your own.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「tu cuenta.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（I never did hang out with anyone after＿the test of courage, so tomorrow I'll be＿seeing everyone for the first time in a）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（No volví a salir con nadie después de＿la prueba de valor, así que mañana veré＿a todos por primera vez en un）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（while.）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（tiempo.）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（She always puts some distance＿between herself and the rest of us, but＿for that moment her walls were）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Ella siempre mantiene cierta distancia＿con los demás, pero en ese momento＿sus barreras habían）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（gone......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（caído......）」"

msgid "\"The part of the lie that they want to＿see, want to hear, want to believe --＿that 'truth' is in there, so they believe\""
msgstr "\"La parte de la mentira que quieren＿ver, quieren oír, quieren creer -- esa＿'verdad' está ahí, así que se creen\""

msgid "the lie. Am I wrong?」"
msgstr "la mentira. ¿Me equivoco?」"

msgid "Minori「How was your winter break,＿Takasu-kun? Oh, I guess that was a＿stupid question. You were dealing with」"
msgstr "Minori「¿Qué tal tus vacaciones de invierno,＿Takasu-kun? Ay, qué pregunta tan tonta.＿Estabas lidiando con」"

msgid "Minori「your amnesia. Sorry.」"
msgstr "Minori「tu amnesia. Perdón.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（But didn't Kushieda WANT a friendly＿relationship like before? Is that why＿she continues to treat me the same as）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（¿Pero Kushieda no QUERÍA una relación＿amistosa como antes? ¿Por eso me sigue＿tratando igual que）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（always?）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（siempre?）」"

msgid "Yuri「If I learn any further details about it, I＿will be sure to share them with the＿class. Now, we mustn't be late for the」"
msgstr "Yuri「Si me entero de más detalles sobre esto,＿se los compartiré a la clase. Ahora,＿no hay que llegar tarde a la」"

msgid "Yuri「opening ceremony. Everyone please＿head to the gym. Kitamura-kun?」"
msgstr "Yuri「ceremonia de apertura. Por favor,＿diríjanse al gimnasio. ¿Kitamura-kun?」"
